{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t亞太「一帶一路」共策會會長、馬來西亞前交通部長翁詩杰說，今次在深圳舉行亞太經合組織會議有重要意義。<br/>\n<br/>\n他又認為，深圳能夠引領整個亞太地區，成為未來科創領域新浪潮中的領頭羊。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T13:44:04.912267+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:15:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:37:56.217130+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T13:37:26.244652+00:00","content_hash":"c2008c82f48c8452b0bf1002afc797f73d95867959566654b72e6b2362f477ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}